      "description": "A scene depicting a tiger lying down with a dejected expression, symbolizing defeat or disappointment. The tiger is the central participant, positioned on a wooden surface, with its head resting on its front paw. The scene is framed by text that contextualizes the tiger's expression as representing the emotional state of someone who has lost their first boxing match. The spatial arrangement centers the tiger, with the text overlaying the top and bottom of the image to provide narrative context.",
