      "instance_name": "defeated_tiger_scene",
      "label": "defeated tiger scene",
      "description": "The scene of a tiger appearing dejected or defeated is a visual metaphor that relies on the cultural understanding that tigers are apex predators, symbolizing power, strength, and dominance. The contrast between this natural role and the depicted state of defeat is central to the meme's humor and requires external knowledge of animal behavior and human symbolic associations with animals.",
