      "instance_name": "tiger_as_apex_predator",
      "label": "tiger as apex predator",
      "description": "Tigers are widely recognized in popular culture and biology as apex predators — the top of the food chain — symbolizing power, strength, and invincibility. This real-world knowledge is necessary to understand the humor of the meme, which hinges on the unexpected and humorous contrast between the tiger's natural dominance and its depicted state of defeat.",
