      "instance_name": "mapping_001",
      "label": "Tiger as defeated person in first boxing match",
      "description": "The visual entity 'defeated_tiger_scene' is mapped onto the textual concept 'first boxing match' to represent a powerful figure (tiger) experiencing the emotional state of defeat after losing their first significant competitive event. The tiger's dejected expression and posture are used as a visual metaphor for the human experience of embarrassment and disappointment after a first loss, creating an analogical mapping between the visual depiction of defeat and the textual description of a first boxing match loss.",
