      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the defeated tiger scene",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual entity 'defeated_tiger_scene', where the tiger's dejected expression and posture serve as a metaphor for the user's own experience of losing their first boxing match. The text 'when you lose your first boxing match' explicitly uses 'you', directing the viewer to identify with the tiger's defeat as a personal, relatable experience. This creates a self-deprecating projection where the user sees themselves in the tiger's defeated state, evoking humor through analogical mapping.",
